03:29.670 --> 03:32.970
another thing we can do is filter them or search.

03:32.970 --> 03:34.110
When we've got a bunch of tags

03:34.110 --> 03:36.030
like we do on this react project,

03:36.030 --> 03:37.680
we can use the dash L.

03:37.680 --> 03:39.930
So it is an L, it kind of looks like a one there

03:39.930 --> 03:42.330
